        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You deploy a station in an adjacent empty space that floats in the air, fueling combatants and keeping them ready to fight on. The station is Small, visibly the source of the healing, has AC 10 and 30 Hit Points, and is immune to critical hits and precision damage. The station also has the tech trait. Anytime you or an ally ends a turn adjacent to the healing station, the adjacent character heals for 5 Hit Points and gains a +1 status bonus to saving throws for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.sf2e.spell-effects.Item.Spell Effect: Build Healing Station]</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+3)</strong> The station's Hit Points increase by 30, and the healing increases by 5.</p>"
